{"availability":"available","full":"NicolasQuirogaweb/niv0web-frontend","name":"niv0web-frontend","description":"Listen to and download my beats, loops and sample packs, with an admin panel. React, Google login, ES/EN. | Escuchá y descargá mis beats, loops y sample packs, con panel admin. React, login con Google, ES/EN.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-11-26T17:06:50Z","updated":"2026-10-03T23:33:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://niv0web.vercel.app","topics":["admin-dashboard","audio-player","axios","google-oauth","i18next","javascript","music","react","react-router","vercel"],"demo":"https://niv0web.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.463Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.463Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.463Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:26.519Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.463Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The frontend of niv0 prod, where I publish my beats, loops and sample packs. You log in with Google, listen in the browser and download what you want. I manage the whole catalog from an admin panel built into the same app.","I built niv0 so that when someone asks me \"do you have beats I can use?\", I can answer with a single link. Artists can browse my beats, loops and sample packs, listen to everything and download what they need, instead of waiting for me to send files one by one. It was also an excuse to build a music app of my own and have full control over how my catalog is shown.","The functionality is where I want it: an interactive catalog and a bridge to contact me. The UI and UX are still evolving while I find the look that fits."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NicolasQuirogaweb/niv0web-frontend/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1b7b4734933cd47c09bf7a063b757303ef0185952c9c99e5e7981a845b0733ab